  {
   "address": 7680,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The first copied byte in the scene record is $06. The caller starts executing one byte later."
  },
  {
   "address": 7681,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Save the caller stack pointer and scan the embedded source at $D010 again using escape $54. Replace the disk-load picture with that decoded image, then transform the glyph data at $7E00 and $7F00 for the second descent."
  },
  {
   "address": 7702,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Scan the original staged bytes at $D010 with I/O banked out to find the END OF CODE marker before reusing the first platform picture."
  },
  {
   "address": 7736,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Point output to $4000 and input to the page after the marker. Save the stream pointer at $2D70/$2D71, then call the shared decoder and transform the glyph bytes in the final two pages."
  },
  {
   "address": 8522,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Toggle between the sprite pose banks and select the base frame index. Test active-low up, down and horizontal input and use the corresponding four-piece frame tables."
  },
  {
   "address": 11634,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Clear the pending sound effect and cycle four sprite pointers over ten CIA2 waits. Select the fourth display matrix and its colour table for the follow-on animation."
  },
  {
   "address": 12154,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "This scene record ends with the eleven byte marker copied by the unpacker at $0DDE."
  },
  {
   "address": 32256,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The second descent rewrites these 512 bytes of the shared character set using $170F. The remaining picture bytes $4000\u2013$7DFF match the first descent before play."
  },
  {
   "address": 37376,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Repeated $07 bytes at $9200\u2013$920F, after the input consumed by the scene picture decode."
  }
